digest and fail closed on absent, malformed, or contradictory values\n- enforce configured maker-complete/safe-rejection splits during final materialization\n- record exact Batch 002 untracked-parent/blob custody and a deterministic candidate-free fixture projection\n- emit complete per-question reconciliation rows with hashes, risk flags, second-read requirements, and zero-call state conservation\n\n## Exact reviewed head\n\nbc317b3e29432975f80b00a23edf54eb29308582\n\n## Deterministic results\n\n- Batch 001: 227 exact, 0 extension, 0 invalid\n- Batch 002 real preserved evidence: 206 exact, 9 authoritative continuation extensions across 6 papers, 0 invalid\n- real packet/evidence bindings exercised: 215/215\n- all 9 extensions: mismatch=true, high_risk=true, independent_second_visual_read_required=true\n- maker/checker/resolver/provider/local VLM/external VLM calls: 0\n\n## Canonical reconciliation receipt recipe\n\nThe publishable Batch 002 receipt SHA-256 is:\n\n1f76b37de26b627e7bc6f9d1f7454949b679212a8154a1b4e297121f2ac826c2\n\nRecipe:\n\n1. Build the complete receipt, including Batch 002 issue/batch identity and the three artifact bindings.\n2. Exclude only the receipt_sha256 field.\n3. Serialize as UTF-8 JSON with sort_keys=true, separators=[\",\",\":\"], ensure_ascii=false, and no trailing newline.\n4. SHA-256 the resulting bytes.\n5. Store the digest as receipt_sha256.\n\nThe regression reconstructs this exact hash from untracked parent 3b7bb8b9dd6f59f04a4697ac774d912a1e9fd3bc, source blob 2a2b6a4c69a184b3f6c2d7935fd681c75d3989c8, source SHA-256 5523c954a3094a114b3498c0b08068e9c1f00251a12fddb4da25ceea019b5be7, and all 215 real packet/evidence bindings.\n\n## Verification commands\n\n- uv run --with pymupdf --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1653_structural_batch_001.test.py\n- uv run --with pymupdf --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1656_authoritative_continuation.test.py\n- node --test scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1650_full_corpus_freeze.test.mjs\n- node --test scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1653_reconcile.test.mjs\n- uv run --with pymupdf --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1653_structural_batch_001.py validate-packets\n- npm run lint:changed\n- git diff --check\n- jq empty scripts/vlm/__tests__/fixtures/issue_1656_batch_002_page_chains.v1.json\n- python3 -m py_compile scripts/vlm/issue_1653_structural_batch_001.py scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1656_authoritative_continuation.test.py\n- npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json\n\nThe preserved Batch 002 authority suite was also executed in-memory from exact paused commit fd34c66dc693811fe04dd3d7968bab0585254d97 without checking out or mutating #1655.\n\nResults:\n\n- Batch 001 runner: 8/8\n- preserved Batch 002 authority: 3/3\n- frozen #1650: 23/23\n- reconciler: 4/4\n- repair/custody/negative/activation suite: 9/9, including a fresh-process validly re-signed contradictory-predecessor rejection\n- Batch 001 packet readiness: pass, provider_calls=0\n- Batch 002 real-evidence reconciliation: pass, calls=0\n- lint/diff/JSON/compile: pass\n- preflight: clean worktree; pre-push ahead warning resolved by push\n\nCloses #1656\n","created_at":"2026-07-21T21:15:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T21:51:31Z","closed_at":"2026-07-21T21:51:31Z","merged_at":"2026-07-21T21:51:31Z","merge_commit_sha":"64d64aa31174c97b56cfdf543fa286c59ecf28f5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1657/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1657/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1657/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/status